    {
      "id": "ragflow-notes-body",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 100,
      "y": 1788,
      "width": 2580,
      "height": 115,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#475569",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 2482183475,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 1249608341,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1790511220169,
      "created": 1790511220169,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "• 普通 Chunk 正文、词项和向量在 ES；task.chunk_ids 仅记录已写入的 ES ID。\n• 可选文档元数据另有 ragflow_doc_meta_{tenant_id}；Go / Pipeline 分支使用 ingestion_task 等表，未画进默认 Python 主链。\n• 源码：document_api.py → task_service.py → task_executor_refactor/{task_handler, chunk_service, embedding_service}.py → search.py / es_conn.py。",
      "fontSize": 19,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "• 普通 Chunk 正文、词项和向量在 ES；task.chunk_ids 仅记录已写入的 ES ID。\n• 可选文档元数据另有 ragflow_doc_meta_{tenant_id}；Go / Pipeline 分支使用 ingestion_task 等表，未画进默认 Python 主链。\n• 源码：document_api.py → task_service.py → task_executor_refactor/{task_handler, chunk_service, embedding_service}.py → search.py / es_conn.py。",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
